"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner, who are top negotiators for Trump, will make their first trip to Kyiv. This is part of ongoing diplomatic efforts.\",            \"english_title\": \"Trump Negotiators Visit Kyiv\",            \"translated_version\": \"Steve Witkoff y Jared Kushner, que son negociadores importantes para Trump, har\u00e1n su primer viaje a Kyiv. Esto es parte de esfuerzos diplom\u00e1ticos.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Negociadores de Trump visitan Kyiv\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The US has announced that it hit three Iranian oil tankers. In response, Iran claims it targeted three ships linked to the US. This is part of the ongoing tensions between the two countries.\",            \"english_title\": \"US-Iran Tensions\",            \"translated_version\": \"Estados Unidos anunci\u00f3 que golpe\u00f3 tres barcos petroleros iran\u00edes. En respuesta, Ir\u00e1n dice que atac\u00f3 tres barcos relacionados con Estados Unidos. Esto es parte de las tensiones entre los dos pa\u00edses.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Tensiones entre Estados Unidos e Ir\u00e1n\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The Prince of Wales will attend the funeral of Harald V in Oslo next week. He will be representing the King at this event.\",            \"english_title\": \"Prince of Wales to Attend Funeral\",            \"translated_version\": \"El Pr\u00edncipe de Gales asistir\u00e1 al funeral de Harald V en Oslo la pr\u00f3xima semana. \u00c9l representar\u00e1 al Rey en este evento.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Pr\u00edncipe de Gales asistir\u00e1 al funeral\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"More than 20,000 passengers are stuck because volcanic ash was found in the airspace near Jakarta. This happened after volcanic eruptions in the area.\",            \"english_title\": \"Volcanic Ash Disrupts Flights\",            \"translated_version\": \"M\u00e1s de 20,000 pasajeros est\u00e1n atrapados porque se encontr\u00f3 ceniza volc\u00e1nica en el espacio a\u00e9reo cerca de Yakarta. Esto pas\u00f3 despu\u00e9s de erupciones volc\u00e1nicas en el \u00e1rea.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Ceniza volc\u00e1nica interrumpe vuelos\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Germany has accused Russia of attacking Leipzig airport. There have been other suspicious incidents happening in different places.\",            \"english_title\": \"Germany Accuses Russia\",            \"translated_version\": \"Alemania acus\u00f3 a Rusia de atacar el aeropuerto de Leipzig. Ha habido otros incidentes sospechosos en diferentes lugares.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Alemania acusa a Rusia\"        }    ]}"